# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A watch face with the date on the dial: the analog clock pattern full
# frame and today's date in tiny type below the hub, where a watch prints it.
S - Analog Date
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Clock
I @pat/analog-clock
L text 0 22 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Date
T clock MM-DD
F tiny aab4c8 c none 0
